rg/t/p/w780/wp2FV4YcfmFojT2MoVKt8sVpQHK.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41000000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63328,\"title\":\"Grandfathered\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4kxhllcajbzQwjYiyXFGJKXmvY5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4042857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63288,\"title\":\"Puppy Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lsVIwxH2gw4rLiXUrqnXswpx0Cv.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4EC9X4TT9RkCQMRQOsP8GIVaS4G.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2010-06-16\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Pilot\",\"overview\":\"In the premiere of this comedy, three women from L.A. on their way to Paris make an emergency landing in Cleveland. They decide to stick around and rent a house with an elderly caretaker.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/reri6G7l7bgyS249xdTlXo0iPzi.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-16\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Who's Your Mama?\",\"overview\":\"Joy's fling with a younger man dredges up a secret from her past. Melanie coaxes Elka to dive back into the dating pool and Victoria's new shopping habits come with fringe benefits.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIMUlRGBddRhWiFb4DYUsR2hmls.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-23\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Birthdates\",\"overview\":\"Elka finds a lot to like about her blind date, though the other ladies aren't so lucky with their respective suitors.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jvh6u1Ajskp8MbhRtt1T8pqS9AG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-06-30\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Sex That Got Away\",\"overview\":\"During an event at the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame, Victoria reconnects with a former rock-star boyfriend, while Melanie gets a bit overzealous with her music idol.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/473J9DxTkYPXAyI5qyCu0oBgaK9.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-07\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Good Neighbors\",\"overview\":\"Melanie throws a party to meet their neighbors and she comes off as insulting to one of her next door neighbors, a columnist for The Plain Dealer, leading Melanie to fear that he'll write something negative about her. Meanwhile, Victoria gets a offer to do a commercial for underpants in Japan and Elka sports a dyed hairdo that draws criticism from Joy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/finpFFZuVhCUelZHDESxJNrtO2t.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-14\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Meet the Parents\",\"overview\":\"Melanie's mother and Victoria's father visit on the same weekend forcing them to see their parents in a new light; Erika brings Joy and her mother together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3bJYORo9fQkLAqX1eDESpUWy6f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-21\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"It's Not That Complicated\",\"overview\":\"Melanie's ex-husband Anders comes to town and she starts to have feelings for him again. Meanwhile, Elka tries to juggle relationships with two men.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8iw7ijDQudphfBx5bMbsQGO7OqM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-07-28\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Play's the Thing\",\"overview\":\"Victoria lends her acting expertise to a high school's production of \\\"Romeo and Juliet\\\". Melanie's new romance causes a rift with Joy. Elka crashes funerals.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p7qlrKnCpKxj5LAR8whhJKn9REC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-04\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Good Luck Faking the Goiter\",\"overview\":\"Melanie comes to regret her nosy nature when her son pays a visit. Elka helps Victoria campaign for sympathy votes after she's nominated for a Daytime Emmy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2SOGaqDJprSbEEC9CVVkZ4JeKzM.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-11\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Tornado\",\"overview\":\"In the first-season finale, threats of a tornado cause the ladies to seek shelter in Elka's secret room in the cellar, but they're nearly blown away by what they find.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2rp2gwf1w6tGNz9Eyv2lsxKl4Kp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2010-08-18\",\"runtime\":20}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2010-06-16\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}